  step=2,dige:451a4f3a55e55410
    Assertion:four-selves-stand-up,sentence:four selves stand up online — an issuer a first tip and two newcomers waiting to chain in
  step=3,dige:ac88d45a1393aab3
    Assertion:the-chain-invite-seals,sentence:the chain invite seals its first friend and tracks him as the tip — never spent so the link can move on
  step=4,dige:78022471765ab256
    Assertion:a-newcomer-holding-the,sentence:a newcomer holding the link grows the chain — the TIP not the issuer grants her and seals a real friendship
    Assertion:the-newcomer-never-befriends,sentence:the newcomer never befriends the issuer — no grant and no contact only a light chain-root kept for later
    Assertion:the-issuer-advances-her,sentence:the issuer advances her tracker to the newcomer on the tip signed confirmation
  step=5,dige:50186e0060a4940c
    Assertion:the-chain-grows-past,sentence:the chain grows PAST the first tip — the newcomer honours via the chain-root she kept not a friendship with the issuer
    Assertion:no-escalation-down-the,sentence:no escalation down the chain — the far hop still grants exactly the embedded Music Feature
    Assertion:the-tracker-advances-again,sentence:the tracker advances again to the second newcomer — the chain outlives any single friendship with the issuer
